 "title": "Sci-Fi Warble",
 "category": "Effects",
 "text": "Sound: the warbling, wobbling flying-saucer sound of old sci-fi films: a tone trembling fast while it slowly rises and falls.\n\nHow it's built: two LFOs mixed into the oscillator's FM: a fast one (9 Hz) for the warble, a slow one for the drift. A sine through a Delay and Reverb.\n\nPlay: hold a high note.\n\nTweak: each LFO's RATE and its mixer level, the oscillator's FM.",
